---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="SMS Privacy Policy — Ivantsov.tech"
	description="Privacy policy for the Ivantsov personal-assistant SMS service."
>
	<Nav />
	<main class="px-6 pt-24 md:pt-36 pb-16">
		<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
			<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">SMS Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-sm opacity-[0.78]">Personal-Assistant Messaging Service — Alex Ivantsov, Sole Proprietor. Last updated: July 28, 2026.</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">What this service is</h2>
			<p>
				This SMS program delivers personal-assistant notifications — calendar and
				appointment reminders, task and bill-due notifications, daily schedule
				summaries, and replies to messages you initiate. It serves the account
				owner and a small number of household members who personally requested
				it. It is not offered to the general public.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">Information we collect</h2>
			<p>
				Your mobile phone number, your opt-in consent record, and the content of
				messages you send to and receive from the service. Nothing else.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">How it is used</h2>
			<p>
				Solely to deliver the notifications and replies described above, and to
				honor opt-out requests. Message logs are retained only as needed to
				operate the service.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">No sharing of mobile information</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>
					No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates
					for marketing or promotional purposes. All other categories exclude
					text-messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information
					will not be shared with, or sold to, any third parties.
				</strong>
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">Message frequency and rates</h2>
			<p>
				Message frequency varies with your calendar and requests — typically
				fewer than 10 messages per day. <strong>Message and data rates may
				apply</strong> according to your mobile carrier plan.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">Opting out and help</h2>
			<p>
				Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out; you will receive one
				final confirmation message. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance,
				or contact <a href="mailto:alex@ivantsov.tech" class="underline">alex@ivantsov.tech</a>.
			</p>

			<p class="pt-4 text-sm opacity-[0.78]">
				See also the <a href="/sms-terms" class="underline">SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
			</p>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
